<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES-Duty Free International, Wyle Electronics, Buenos Aires Embotelladora and Huntingdon Life.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES-Duty Free International, Wyle Electronics, Buenos Aires Embotelladora and Huntingdon Life.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday that Duty Free International Inc, Wyle Electronics, Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA and Huntingdon Life were unavailable.</p>
<p>NS Group Inc and Providence Energy Corp were unavailable for news.</p>
</text>
